sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant B as Browser
  participant G as Gateway
  participant A as Auth
  participant O as Orders
  participant P as Payments
  participant Q as Queue
  participant M as Mailer
  U->>B: Place order
  B->>G: POST /orders
  G->>A: Check session
  A-->>G: OK
  G->>O: Create order
  O->>P: Charge card
  P-->>O: Charged
  O->>Q: Order created
  Q->>M: Send receipt
  M-->>U: Email
  O-->>G: 201 Created
  G-->>B: Order id
  B-->>U: Show receipt
